join ember (normal) right [animation="Fade In"]
ember: Five days. That's actually something of a record for me.
ember (smug): Can I be a little vain and ask how I'm doing? Be honest.
[wait time="0.1"]
- You're doing amazing. Better than amazing.
	ember: Okay, now you're just showing off with the compliments. (+20 Charm)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":20}"]
	ember: Keep going. I won't stop you.
	- You're stubborn, sharp, and worth every wave.
		ember: Okay, "worth every wave" got me. (+10 Charm)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":10}"]
	- I think that's enough ego for one day.
		ember: Fair. I'll take what I got. (+10 Wit)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":10}"]
- You're doing fine. It's me who should be nervous.
	ember: Ha — a little self-deprecating, but I appreciate the honesty. (+20 Wit)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":20}"]
	ember: Don't be nervous. I don't bite. Usually.
	- Noted. I'll stay alert anyway.
		ember: Smart. I like a little caution. (+10 Wit)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":10}"]
	- Then don't give me a reason to be.
		ember: Deal. (+10 Trust)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":10}"]
- I'm proud of how far we've come.
	ember: That's... really sweet, actually. (+20 Trust)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":20}"]
	ember: I don't think I've said this back yet, but — same. I'm proud of us too.
	- "Us." I like hearing you say that.
		ember: Get used to it. (+10 Trust)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":10}"]
	- Then let's keep giving ourselves reasons to be.
		ember (sad): That means more than you'd guess. (Vulnerability risk)
		do GameManager.apply_vulnerability_risk(10, 0.65)
		if {last_vulnerability_success} == true:
			ember: I don't say that kind of thing lightly. I meant it.
		else:
			ember (sad): I don't know why that's harder to say than it should be.
ember: Okay, enough vanity for one day.
ember: Let's not let it go to my head before the wave hits.
do GameManager.end_dialauge()